    function testRegression_property() public {
        // Fund the contract with 1 ether
        vm.deal(address(c), 1 ether);
        // Now call sendMoney from the owner to some target with 1 ether
        // The target will be a contract that rejects ether (no receive/fallback) to force revert in reference
        // But for simplicity we use address(0) which has no code; call{value:...} to address(0) always succeeds in Solidity >=0.8.0
